# Default owners for the whole repository: the @beel-es/developers team.
# Membership is managed in one place (org Settings → Teams), so adding or
# removing a person updates this rule in every repository that uses it.
# It only becomes mandatory where the branch ruleset requires a Code Owner review.
*                       @beel-es/developers

# Sensitive paths — the publishing chain, CI, Worker security and the contract.
# A change here is always reviewed by the team.
/.github/               @beel-es/developers
/src/cf/                @beel-es/developers
/openapi/               @beel-es/developers
/package.json           @beel-es/developers
